---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Labs — ProbablyFine" description="Experiments, one-offs, and the hardware behind the lab.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-16 pb-16">
    <p class="font-mono text-sm text-[--color-accent]">$ ls ./labs</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-3">Labs</h1>
    <p class="text-[--color-ink-dim] mt-3 max-w-2xl">
      Experiments, half-finished ideas, and the hardware that powers the homelab. A curated
      tour of the rack is on the way.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 p-6 rounded border border-[--color-line] font-mono text-sm text-[--color-ink-dim]">
      <span class="text-[--color-warn]">WIP</span> — the hardware inventory and lab notes are
      being written. In the meantime, the <a href="/blog">blog</a> has the architecture
      deep-dives.
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
